        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Duibaek paengc thangc laupuk guay adih gay!",
            "Hymdaic e, meic ching ching kaduaina,",
            "’Ki zauzian lev hymdaih padikmei zawpaanv!",
            "Guloumei pu ta kida ngam cho!",
            "",
            "Oh ching ruh pangc khou Kamei gay liang e!",
            "Kata thuanhmei duiluath kumc lik diu:",
            "“Kamei hei gay karucsinghmei pu kiu e!”",
            "Mi hei tingsaeng aniu lu sw ni!",
            "",
            "2 “Gay liangmei khou gay karucsinghmei e!”",
            "Nang ta zianna Kamei kaw bam e;",
            "He abumaengc Karingcbamv hei laa lak cho,",
            "Padikmei nsa nang khang tiimei?",
            "",
            "3 “Gay liangmei khou gay karucsinghmei e!”",
            "Kakhwan ’king o, adih nuh gay cho:",
            "“Guang o, nangniw lakmei, puatrith phunghmei thiu,",
            "Akhou guang o, zaeng tii’thaekclou ni!”"
          ]
        }
      }
